<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Weekend Warrior</title>
</head>
<body>
    <% if (day == "1" || day == "2" || day == "3" || day == "4" || day == "5") { %>
        <h2>Hey, it is a weekday, it is time to work hard!</h2>
        <p>Don't forget to exercise and stretch your body.</p>
    <% } else { %>
        <h2>Hey, it is the weekend, it is time to enjoy your day off!</h2>
        <p>Have fun!</p>
    <% } %>
</body>
</html>
